terminal emulator ought to provide a way to use them.  this really is not
an issue for nethack (in my opinion) altho it would be a friendly add-on.

i often use the configurable function keys on the terminals that i use
to write little macros like "Ea   Elbereth".  seems like a wizardly thing
to do ...

